{"id":"bb96ce122f7cd0ef","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-hornfunc.md","title":"Horn function (DNF convention)","display":"df-hornfunc — Horn function (DNF convention)","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-hornfunc","aliases":["27-df-hornfunc"],"display":"df-hornfunc — Horn function (DNF convention)","depends_on":["[[27-df-horndnf]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-hornfunc"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-hornfunc</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-hornfunc — Horn function (DNF convention)"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4ef7bb7896ef8f96\" href=\"?note=4ef7bb7896ef8f96\" title=\"27-df-horndnf\">27-df-horndnf</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\([n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}\">\\(\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}\\)</span>, as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5d10aed668d85817\" href=\"?note=5d10aed668d85817\" title=\"27-df-boolfunc\">27-df-boolfunc</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DNF}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n:\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n:\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\)</span> are as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0b618255959ff4bc\" href=\"?note=0b618255959ff4bc\" title=\"27-df-dnf\">27-df-dnf</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HornDNF}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{HornDNF}_n\\)</span> is defined in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4ef7bb7896ef8f96\" href=\"?note=4ef7bb7896ef8f96\" title=\"27-df-horndnf\">27-df-horndnf</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n:\\exists D\\in\\mathrm{HornDNF}_n\\;(f=\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n:\\exists D\\in\\mathrm{HornDNF}_n\\;(f=\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Crama–Hammer (2011), §6.1, Definition 6.4，印刷页 271，PDF 第 295 页（从 1 计数）。 已按原书修正旧版本的 TRUE 点交闭方向；本定义等价于 FALSE 点交闭，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"584eb5a4dd07e7fb\" href=\"?note=584eb5a4dd07e7fb\" title=\"27-thm-hornchar\">27-thm-hornchar</a>。常零与常一均为 Horn。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-horndnf","status":"resolved","id":"4ef7bb7896ef8f96","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-horndnf]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-boolfunc","status":"resolved","id":"5d10aed668d85817","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$, $[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$; $\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}$ and $\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}$, as in [[27-df-boolfunc]].","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-dnf","status":"resolved","id":"0b618255959ff4bc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DNF}_n$ and $\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n:\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$ are as in [[27-df-dnf]].","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-horndnf","status":"resolved","id":"4ef7bb7896ef8f96","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HornDNF}_n$ is defined in [[27-df-horndnf]].","embed":false},{"target":"27-thm-hornchar","status":"resolved","id":"584eb5a4dd07e7fb","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"来源：Crama–Hammer (2011), §6.1, Definition 6.4，印刷页 271，PDF 第 295 页（从 1 计数）。 已按原书修正旧版本的 TRUE 点交闭方向；本定义等价于 FALSE 点交闭，见 [[27-thm-hornchar]]。常零与常一均为 Horn。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DNF}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n:\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HornDNF}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n:\\exists D\\in\\mathrm{HornDNF}_n\\;(f=\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D))\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1026,"backlinks":[{"id":"1783030450408811","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{QuadFunc}_n$（see [[27-df-quadfunc]]）和书中 Horn DNF 约定的 $\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n$（see [[27-df-hornfunc]]）。"},{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-232","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-hornfunc|df-hornfunc — Horn function (DNF convention)]]"},{"id":"107965fb6156fc4c","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"目录中仍可定位的主要约定入口是 [[27-df-hornfunc]]、[[27-df-monotone]]、[[27-df-unate]]、[[27-df-quadfunc]]、[[27-df-quadpb]]、[[27-df-mindnf]] 与 [[27-df-irredundant]]。这些节点分别保留 Horn 的零方程约定、正性与 unate 的区别、两种二次性，以及最少表示与不可约表示的区别。各节点中的旧来源字段只作为原附件的来源记录保留；缺少对应 PDF 时，字段存在不等于本次已核验源文。"},{"id":"584eb5a4dd07e7fb","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n$, $F(f)$ and $\\mathrm{MeetCl}_n$ are defined in [[27-df-hornfunc]], [[27-df-truefalse]] and [[27-df-meetclosure]]."},{"id":"85670ccd44cbb85c","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n$, $\\mathrm{Dual}_n$ and $T(g)$ are defined in [[27-df-hornfunc]], [[27-df-dual]] and [[27-df-truefalse]]."},{"id":"c841e9e05634a859","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n$, $\\mathrm{HornDNF}_n$ and $\\mathrm{HornClause}_n$ are defined in [[27-df-hornfunc]], [[27-df-horndnf]] and [[27-df-hornclause]]."},{"id":"9f9fb3e4bf8fdf7c","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n$ is defined in [[27-df-hornfunc]]."},{"id":"19a4cf094048e2b4","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$F(f)$ is defined in [[27-df-truefalse]]; $\\bigwedge R=(\\min\\{a_i:a\\in R\\})_{i\\in[n]}$ for nonempty $R\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n$; $\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n$ is defined in [[27-df-hornfunc]]."},{"id":"1bbf751ce7a46128","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HornMinorant}_n$ and $\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n$ are defined in [[27-df-hornminorant]] and [[27-df-hornfunc]]."},{"id":"cd4ceead6b210901","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n$, $\\mathrm{PureHorn}_n$, $\\mathrm{HornTerm}_n$, $\\mathrm{PureHornTerm}_n$ and $\\mathrm{PI}$ are defined in [[27-df-hornfunc]], [[27-df-purehorn]], [[27-df-hornterm]] and [[27-df-piset]]."},{"id":"cd6815db60d4efdb","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\boldsymbol1^{(n)}=(1)_{i\\in[n]}$; $\\mathrm{PureHorn}_n$ and $\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n$ are defined in [[27-df-purehorn]] and [[27-df-hornfunc]]."},{"id":"52133a217eacf267","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n$ is defined in [[27-df-hornfunc]]; $\\mathbf{coNP}$ is defined in [[27-df-conp]]."},{"id":"d5649903f3f896c7","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$(T,F)\\in\\mathrm{pdBf}_n$；扩张见 [[27-df-extension]]，书籍 Horn 类见 [[27-df-hornfunc]]，阈值类见 [[27-df-threshold]]。$\\mathbb R$ 使用通常实数运算，$w\\cdot x=\\sum_{i\\in[n]}w_ix_i$。"},{"id":"8f5ab08dd390d871","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$。$h\\in\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n$，$U=\\mathrm{QCl}(\\mathrm{PI}(h))$，$\\mathrm{RD}_n(U;R,D)$；见 [[27-df-hornfunc]]、[[27-df-piset]]、[[27-df-rdpartition]]。$\\eta\\subseteq U$ 且 $\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(\\eta)=h$。"}],"outgoing":["4ef7bb7896ef8f96","5d10aed668d85817","0b618255959ff4bc","584eb5a4dd07e7fb"]}